    "extracted_text": "POLICY UPDATE 445\n\nEffective Date: October 15, 2023\n\nSubject: Enhanced Security Protocols for Remote Access\n\nAll employees accessing internal HR systems from external networks must utilize the designated VPN gateway. Multi-factor authentication is now mandatory for all administrative accounts. Failure to comply may result in revocation of access privileges.\n\nAdditionally, all data transfers exceeding 50MB must be logged via the secure audit portal. This policy supersedes Update 312.\n\nApproved by: Security Compliance Office\nReference: SEC-2023-445",
